TI  - An elicitation of the dynamic nature of water vapor feedback in climate change using a 1D model.
AU  - Hallegatte, Stéphane
AU  - Lahellec, Alain
AU  - Grandpeix, Jean-Yves
PY  - 2006
DA  - 2006/01/01
T2  - Journal of the Atmospheric Sciences
SN  - 0022-4928
VL  - 63
