TI  - Can Uncertainty Justify Overlapping Policy Instruments to Mitigate Emissions?
AU  - Lecuyer, Oskar
AU  - Quirion, Philippe
PY  - 2013
DA  - 2013/01/01
T2  - Ecological Economics
SN  - 0921-8009
VL  - 93
