AB  - Scenarios for deep decarbonation for freight transport in france. Two distinct scenarios are presented, one focused on technological progress and the other one on a transition towards a more frugal and environmentally virtuous demand for freight transport. In both cases, a goal oriented backcasting prospective analysis is derived. Scenarios are based on qualitative storylines, distinguishing a detailed sequence of mechanisms, from demand formation to GHG emissions. A quantitative approach is also developed in other to quantify decarbonations pathways in a self-consistent way.
