TI  - Towards Road Sustainability—Part II: Applied Holistic Assessment and Lessons Learned from French Highway Resurfacing Strategies
AU  - de Bortoli, Anne
AU  - Féraille, Adélaïde
AU  - Leurent, Fabien
PY  - 2022
DA  - 2022/06/15
T2  - Sustainability
SN  - 2071-1050
VL  - 14
