TI  - The equity and efficiency trade-off of carbon tax revenue recycling: A re-examination
AU  - Combet, Emmanuel
AU  - Le Treut, Gaëlle
AU  - Méjean, Aurélie
AU  - Teixeira, Antoine
PY  - 2025
DA  - 2025/05/08
T2  - Energy Economics
