TI  - Extreme climate variability should be considered in forestry-assisted migration
AU  - Benito-Garzon, Marta
AU  - Ha-Duong, Minh
AU  - Frascaria-Lacoste, Nathalie
AU  - Fernandez-Manharres, Fernandez
